;===============================
; Filters (.anm2)
;===============================
[PageRoll_S]
距離=Length
角度=Angle
太さ=Thickness
カメラ設定=Camera Settings
視点X=X-Viewpoint
視点Y=Y-Viewpoint
視野角=Field of View
陰影=Shadow Intensity
領域外も描画=Extend Drawing Area
裏地設定=Lining Settings
裏地種類=Lining Type
元画像/画像ファイル=Original / Image File
フレームバッファ=Frame Buffer
仮想バッファ=Temporal Buffer
一時キャッシュ=Temporal Cache
裏地画像=Lining Image
キャッシュ名=Cache Name
裏地向き=Lining Orientation
通常=Normal
左右反転=Flip Horizontally
上下反転=Flip Vertically
180°反転=180° Flip
その他=Misc

[Tips.PageRoll_S]
effect.name=Rolls up the image like a page
角度=Specifies the angle of the direction. Zero is toward up, positive goes clockwise.
領域外も描画=Extends the drawing area if the rolled portion extends beyond the original image size.
裏地画像=Uses the original image if not specified.
キャッシュ名=The part "---" of the cache name "cache:---". Valid only if "Temporal Cache" is selected in "Lining Type".


